#: ../../api/utils.md:5
msgid "Utilities"
msgstr "ユーティリティ"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume:1
msgid "Compute hypervolume indicator (minimization convention)."
msgstr "超体積指標を計算します（最小化規約）。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume:3
msgid ""
"The hypervolume (S-metric) indicator was introduced by Zitzler & Thiele "
"(1998) as a way to measure the quality of a Pareto front approximation "
"without a priori knowledge of the true front."
msgstr "超体積（S指標）は、真のフロントを事前に知らなくてもパレートフロント近似の品質を測る方法としてZitzlerとThiele（1998）が導入しました。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume:7
msgid ""
"Uses a recursive slicing algorithm. Complexity: O(n^(m-1) * n log n), "
"where n is the number of points and m is the number of objectives."
msgstr "再帰的なスライスアルゴリズムを使います。計算量はO(n^(m-1) * n log n)です。nは点数、mは目的数です。"

#: ../../api/utils.md of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume:10
msgid "Objective matrix, shape (n, n_obj)."
msgstr "目的値行列。形状は(n, n_obj)です。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume:12
msgid ""
"Reference (nadir) point, shape (n_obj,). Each component must be strictly "
"greater than the corresponding component of at least one point in f for a"
" non-zero hypervolume to be returned."
msgstr "参照（nadir）点。形状は(n_obj,)です。ゼロでない超体積を返すには、各成分がf内の少なくとも1点の対応する成分より厳密に大きくなければなりません。"

#: ../../api/utils.md of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume:17
msgid "Hypervolume value."
msgstr "超体積の値です。"

#: ../../api/utils.md of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:1
msgid "Compute exclusive hypervolume contributions for each point."
msgstr "各点の排他的超体積寄与を計算します。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:3
msgid "The exclusive contribution of point ``i`` is defined as::"
msgstr "点``i``の排他的寄与は次のように定義されます::"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:7
msgid ""
"i.e. the volume exclusively dominated by point ``i`` relative to the "
"reference point.  Higher is better, consistent with the library-wide "
"convention.  Dominated points and points not strictly better than the "
"reference point contribute 0."
msgstr "つまり、参照点に対して点``i``だけが支配する体積です。ライブラリ全体の規約どおり値が大きいほど良く、支配された点や参照点より厳密に良くない点の寄与は0です。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:12
msgid ""
"This function reuses :func:`hypervolume` and therefore inherits the "
"minimisation convention internally.  Use the ``direction`` parameter to "
"handle maximisation objectives."
msgstr ""
"この関数は {py:func}`hypervolume` を再利用するため、内部では最小化規約を引き継ぎます。 最大化する目的には "
"``direction`` パラメータを使ってください。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:17
msgid ""
"Computing hypervolume is exponential in the number of objectives, and the"
" leave-one-out loop adds a factor of N.  For many objectives or large N "
"this becomes prohibitively expensive.  A future improvement may "
"incorporate a faster batch hypervolume algorithm (e.g. the slicing-based "
"approach of While, Hingston, Barone & Huband, 2006; paper not yet "
"obtained -- name only, not to be confused with the WFG benchmark-problem "
"paper by Huband et al., 2006, which is a different work despite the "
"overlapping author list)."
msgstr ""
"超体積の計算量は目的数に対して指数的で、1個抜きのループによってNの係数も加わります。目的数やNが大きい場合、非常に高コストになります。将来は、より高速なバッチ超体積アルゴリズム（例：While、Hingston、Barone、Huband、2006年のスライス法）を取り入れられる可能性があります。論文は未入手のため名称だけを示します。著者名が重なる別研究であるHuband"
" et al., 2006のWFGベンチマーク問題論文とは異なるため、混同しないでください。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:26
msgid "Objective matrix, shape ``(N, n_obj)``."
msgstr "目的値行列。形状は``(N, n_obj)``です。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:28
msgid ""
"Reference point in the *original* objective space, shape ``(n_obj,)``.  "
"If ``None``, it is auto-computed from the data with a fractional padding "
"controlled by ``margin``."
msgstr "*元の*目的空間における参照点。形状は``(n_obj,)``です。``None``の場合は、``margin``で制御される割合の余白を使ってデータから自動計算します。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:32
msgid ""
"Per-objective optimisation direction: ``+1`` to maximise, ``-1`` to "
"minimise.  ``None`` defaults to all-minimise (equivalent to "
"``np.full(n_obj, -1.0)``).  Same convention as "
":func:`saealib.comparators.spea2_fitness`."
msgstr ""
"目的ごとの最適化方向です。最大化には``+1``、最小化には``-1``を使います。``None``ではすべて最小化（``np.full(n_obj,"
" -1.0)``相当）になります。{py:func}`saealib.comparators.spea2_fitness`と同じ規約です。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:37
msgid ""
"Fractional padding used when auto-computing the reference point. For each"
" objective axis the auto reference is placed at ``nadir + margin * "
"span``.  Ignored when ``reference_point`` is provided."
msgstr ""
"参照点の自動計算に使う割合の余白です。各目的軸では自動参照点を``nadir + margin * "
"span``に置きます。``reference_point``を指定した場合は無視されます。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:43
msgid ""
"Exclusive hypervolume contribution per point, shape ``(N,)``. All values "
"are ``>= 0`` (dominated / out-of-reference points get 0)."
msgstr "点ごとの排他的超体積寄与。形状は``(N,)``です。すべての値は``>= 0``で、支配された点や参照範囲外の点は0になります。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:48
#: saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:25
msgid "References"
msgstr "参照"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:49
msgid "Beume, N., Naujoks, B., & Emmerich, M. (2007)."
msgstr "Beume, N., Naujoks, B., & Emmerich, M.（2007）。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:50
msgid ""
"SMS-EMOA: Multiobjective selection based on dominated hypervolume. "
"*European Journal of Operational Research*, 181(3), 1653-1669. "
"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejor.2006.08.008"
msgstr ""
"SMS-EMOA：被支配超体積に基づく多目的選択。*European Journal of Operational Research*, "
"181(3), 1653–1669。https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejor.2006.08.008"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:54
msgid "Zitzler, E., & Thiele, L. (1998)."
msgstr "Zitzler, E., & Thiele, L.（1998）。"

#: of saealib.utils.indicators.hypervolume_contributions:55
msgid ""
"Multiobjective optimization using evolutionary algorithms - a comparative"
" case study.  *PPSN V*, LNCS 1498, pp. 292-301."
msgstr "進化アルゴリズムを用いた多目的最適化―比較事例研究。*PPSN V*, LNCS 1498, pp. 292–301。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:1
msgid "Generate weight vectors uniformly distributed on the unit simplex."
msgstr "単体上に一様分布する重みベクトルを生成します。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:3
msgid ""
"Uses the simplex lattice design described in Das & Dennis (1998), widely "
"applied in MOEA/D (Zhang & Li, 2007) and NSGA-III (Deb & Jain, 2014)."
msgstr ""
"DasとDennis（1998）が示した単体格子設計を使います。この設計はMOEA/D（Zhang & Li, 2007）やNSGA-"
"III（Deb & Jain, 2014）で広く使われています。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each weight vector ``w`` satisfies ``sum(w) == 1`` and ``w_i >= 0``. The "
"granularity is ``1 / n_divisions``; each component takes a value in ``{0,"
" 1/H, 2/H, ..., 1}`` where ``H = n_divisions``."
msgstr ""
"各重みベクトル``w``は``sum(w) == 1``および``w_i >= 0``を満たします。粒度は``1 / "
"n_divisions``で、各成分は``H = n_divisions``における``{0, 1/H, 2/H, ..., "
"1}``のいずれかです。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:10
msgid "The number of vectors returned is ``math.comb(n_obj + H - 1, H)``."
msgstr "返されるベクトルの数は``math.comb(n_obj + H - 1, H)``です。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:12
msgid "Number of objectives. Must be >= 2."
msgstr "目的数。2以上でなければなりません。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:14
msgid ""
"Number of divisions ``H`` along each axis. Must be >= 1. Larger values "
"produce more weight vectors and finer coverage."
msgstr "各軸の分割数``H``。1以上でなければなりません。大きい値ほど多くの重みベクトルが生成され、カバレッジが細かくなります。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:18
msgid ""
"Weight matrix, shape ``(N, n_obj)``. Each row sums to 1.0 and all entries"
" are non-negative."
msgstr "重み行列。形状は``(N, n_obj)``です。各行の合計は1.0で、すべての要素が非負です。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "発生する例外"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:22
msgid "If ``n_obj < 2`` or ``n_divisions < 1``."
msgstr "``n_obj < 2``または``n_divisions < 1``の場合です。"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:26
msgid ""
":cite:`zhang2007moead`: Zhang, Q., & Li, H. (2007). MOEA/D: A "
"multiobjective evolutionary algorithm based on decomposition. *IEEE "
"Transactions on Evolutionary Computation*, 11(6), 712-731. (Appendix A "
"describes the simplex lattice design originally due to Das & Dennis, "
"1998.)"
msgstr ""
":cite:`zhang2007moead`: Zhang, Q., & Li, H. (2007)。MOEA/D: "
"分解に基づく多目的進化アルゴリズム。*IEEE Transactions on Evolutionary Computation*, 11(6),"
" 712-731。(付録Aでは、Das & Dennis, 1998に由来する単体格子設計を説明します。)"

#: of saealib.utils.weight_vectors.uniform_weight_vectors:33
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"
